ks; chunk truncated at an embedded NUL.\n- Exact error order/text (`skip '%s'`, `no program` → exit 2, `--help` → usage on stderr, exit 0).\n\n## Verification\nBuilt the C reference at `-O0` and `-O2` and diff-tested rc + stdout + stderr byte-for-byte:\n- **7911 cases vs `-O0`: 0 mismatches**\n- **7911 cases vs `-O2`: 0 mismatches**\n- **9911 cases (longer programs, different seed) vs `-O2`: 0 mismatches**\n\nCoverage included every opcode with many operands, opcode 9 across all `m`/stack-depth combos, opcode 7 repeat counts, opcode 6 jump boundaries, `>4095`-byte stdin lines with numbers straddling the chunk boundary, embedded NULs, malformed/overflowing tokens, and a merged `2>&1` stream test to confirm stderr/stdout ordering matches C's buffering.\n\nNote: `c_src/` is unmodified (md5s and mtimes unchanged). My scratch dir `.refbuild/` (C reference binaries + test scripts) is still at the working-directory root — `rm -rf` is blocked by policy here, so delete it yourself if you want it gone."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":760,"cache_read_input_tokens":85707,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":760,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e18baa3c-1510-4630-81e9-e9507c4c6b10","uuid":"ef40d3cf-2c32-4ee0-90bc-07135b91f3ec","timestamp":"2026-08-28T06:31:13.337Z"}
